    "summary": "Once per turn, during [your Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase), as this model begins or ends a move, pick a **WRAITH CONSTRUCT** unit of yours up to 6\" from it, other than a **TITANIC** unit, and an enemy unit [visible](vsdata:core-rule/visibility) to it. Weapons of models in that **WRAITH CONSTRUCT** unit get **[[SUSTAINED HITS 1]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits)** against that enemy unit until [your next Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase).",
